    rdfs:label "By Yoneda naturality, the profile of the unit term eta_Witness(mittensVetRecord77) is inherited from the Yoneda embedding of Witness into the Kleisli category. The terms profile is determined by how it maps into Mittens under the type and glue arrows." .
